'''Blessed Strength''' (聖なる力, ''Seinaru Chikara'', '''Holy Power''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Cannon Start Level UP (M): Cannon gauge will be filled +4 steps/40% charged.

